Title: "Discoverer"
Id: "b03d2893-d425-4f6a-878b-9841b297ef7f"

Text: "`discoverer:` records optional open-text discoverer information.

```mlg-fragment
Documented:
. discoverer: \"Cantor\"
```

It is parsed as prose metadata. Person records can be represented separately with top-level `Person:` groups."
Id: "b7c7bcf3-e79d-43e8-98da-60c9f938cdc9"
